# Apple TV F1 (U.S.) remote rule set for Loon
#
# Purpose: route only the Apple endpoints currently observed to be required
# for watching Formula 1 on Apple TV from outside the U.S.
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - Assign this remote rule to a stable U.S. policy/proxy in Loon.
# - This file contains match rules only; it does not hard-code a policy name.
# - Keep this rule above broader Apple DIRECT rules when rule order matters.
#
# Last reviewed: 2026-09-12

# Playback / entitlement
DOMAIN,play-edge.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,known-issues.apple.com

# HLS / live stream delivery
DOMAIN,hls-amt.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,linear.tv.apple.com
